{"task_id": "Mbpp/237", "solution": "def check_occurences(items):\n    \"\"\"\n    Counts occurrences of unordered 2-element tuples in a list, returning a dictionary\n    mapping canonical tuples (min, max) to their counts.\n    \"\"\"\n    counts = {}\n    for item in items:\n        # Canonicalize the tuple by sorting its elements to treat (a, b) and (b, a) as the same.\n        a, b = item\n        canonical_key = tuple(sorted((a, b)))\n        \n        # Increment the count for the canonical key.\n        counts[canonical_key] = counts.get(canonical_key, 0) + 1\n    return counts"}
