{"task_id": "Mbpp/261", "solution": "def division_elements(a, b):\n    \"\"\"\n    Performs element-wise division on two tuples of numbers, coercing results to int if integral.\n    Assumes valid input tuples of equal length with numeric elements and no division by zero.\n    \"\"\"\n    def _coerce_result_type(value: float) -> int | float:\n        \"\"\"Coerces a float to an int if it's mathematically an exact integer.\"\"\"\n        epsilon = 1e-12\n        if abs(value - round(value)) < epsilon:\n            return int(round(value))\n        return float(value)\n\n    results = []\n    for i in range(len(a)):\n        raw_result = a[i] / b[i]\n        results.append(_coerce_result_type(raw_result))\n\n    return tuple(results)"}
