{"task_id": "Mbpp/271", "solution": "def even_Power_Sum(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of the first n even natural numbers, each raised to the fifth power.\n    Assumes n is a non-negative integer.\n    \"\"\"\n    if n == 0:\n        return 0\n\n    # Calculate the sum of the first n natural numbers raised to the fifth power.\n    # The formula for sum_{k=1..n} k^5 is n^2 * (n+1)^2 * (2n^2 + 2n - 1) / 12.\n    n_squared = n * n\n    sum_k_to_5 = n_squared * (n + 1) * (n + 1) * (2 * n_squared + 2 * n - 1) // 12\n\n    # The sum of the first n even natural numbers raised to the fifth power is\n    # sum_{k=1..n} (2k)^5 = 2^5 * sum_{k=1..n} k^5.\n    result = 32 * sum_k_to_5\n    return result"}
