{"task_id": "Mbpp/283", "solution": "def validate(number: int) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"Checks if the frequency of each digit in the integer is less than or equal to the digit itself.\"\"\"\n    abs_str = str(abs(number))\n    counts = {i: 0 for i in range(10)}\n\n    for char_digit in abs_str:\n        digit = int(char_digit)\n        counts[digit] += 1\n\n    for digit_value, frequency in counts.items():\n        if frequency > digit_value:\n            return False\n            \n    return True"}
