{"task_id": "Mbpp/287", "solution": "def square_Sum(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the sum of squares of the first n even natural numbers using a closed-form formula.\n    Assumes n is a non-negative integer.\"\"\"\n    # The sum of squares of the first n even natural numbers (2, 4, ..., 2n) is 4 * sum(k^2 for k=1 to n).\n    # The sum of squares of first n natural numbers is n * (n + 1) * (2 * n + 1) / 6.\n    # Therefore, the result is 4 * n * (n + 1) * (2 * n + 1) // 6.\n    return (4 * n * (n + 1) * (2 * n + 1)) // 6"}
