{"task_id": "Mbpp/453", "solution": "def sumofFactors(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the sum of even factors for a given positive integer n.\"\"\"\n    import math\n\n    factors = set()\n    limit = int(math.isqrt(n))\n    for i in range(1, limit + 1):\n        if n % i == 0:\n            factors.add(i)\n            factors.add(n // i)\n\n    even_factors_sum = 0\n    for factor in factors:\n        if factor % 2 == 0:\n            even_factors_sum += factor\n\n    return even_factors_sum"}
