{"task_id": "Mbpp/457", "solution": "def Find_Min(lists):\n    \"\"\"Finds the sublist with the minimum length from a list of lists.\n    If multiple sublists have the same minimum length, the first one encountered is returned.\n    \"\"\"\n    min_length = None\n    min_sublist = None\n\n    for sublist in lists:\n        current_length = len(sublist)\n        if min_length is None or current_length < min_length:\n            min_length = current_length\n            min_sublist = sublist\n            \n    return min_sublist"}
